      "12": "ois apekalufqh oti ouc eautois hmin de dihkonoun auta a nun anhggelh umin dia twn euaggelisamenwn umas en pneumati agiw apostalenti ap ouranou eis a epiqumousin aggeloi parakuyai",
      "13": "dio anazwsamenoi tas osfuas ths dianoias umwn nhfontes teleiws elpisate epi thn feromenhn umin carin en apokaluyei ihsou cristou",
      "14": "ws tekna upakohs mh suschmatizomenoi tais proteron en th agnoia umwn epiqumiais",
      "15": "alla kata ton kalesanta umas agion kai autoi agioi en pash anastrofh genhqhte",
